    {
      "source": "Store implementations should provide their own flavor of <a href=\"ValueConversionContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>ValueConversionContext</code></a> enhancing the existing API,\nimplementing delegates for <a href=\"#read(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>read(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a>, <a href=\"#write(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>write(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "存储实现应提供其自身风格的<a href=\"ValueConversionContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>ValueConversionContext</code></a>接口，以增强现有 API，并为<a href=\"#read(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>read(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a>和<a href=\"#write(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>write(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a>实现委托。",
