    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ValueConversionContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>ValueConversionContext</code></a> provides access to the store-specific <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> and allows to\ncall the store-default conversion through the read/write methods.",
      "translation": "`ValueConversionContext` 接口提供了对特定存储的 `PersistentProperty` 的访问权限，并允许通过读写方法调用存储默认的转换功能。",
